          "body": "## Summary\n\n- publish the complete numbered 1–965 doFast roadmap in the repository;\n- preserve every original checklist item exactly once and normalize four lines that previously contained two item numbers;\n- refresh the active authorization/privacy status through merged PR #230;\n- add status totals (612 complete, 2 core-complete-with-external-blocker, 86 partial/in-audit, 265 pending/external);\n- summarize the security, realtime/session, financial and persisted-identity work added since the previous snapshot;\n- record the verified branch-protection blocker (`master protected=false`, required checks off, no rulesets) without claiming it is solved.\n\n## Validation\n\n- item numbers 1 through 965 occur exactly once;\n- no missing or duplicate checklist ids;\n- status counts sum to 965;\n- the audited code baseline is merge commit `837cbe7769842e9007b9088f8255a03febadada2` (PR #230), whose exact-head and post-merge CI/runtime, CodeQL and container-security gates are green.\n\n## Scope\n\nDocumentation only. No runtime, API, schema, workflow or production behavior changes.\n\nMerge only after every workflow triggered for exact head `ab7bc9d53f10abb49ec9e900ed3d4309f0b9c7a7` is green, reviews are clear and `master` is unchanged. Merge commit only.",
